                null),
            new CommentSeed("ada-lovelace", "Oliver", "Bennett",
                "I visited the Science Museum in London and seeing the Difference Engine built from Babbage's own drawings really puts this story in perspective. It is enormous, thousands of parts, and it actually works. Standing in front of it makes you realize how ambitious the Analytical Engine was, and how far ahead Lovelace's notes were.",
